'''Roland Sporeling''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] found in the mountains above [[Frostfang Caverns]], in front of the Diamondback Raceway.

==Trivia==
*The character Roland Sporeling is based on the Diamondback Raceway's creator, Roland Spore, who was also the creator of [[BrawlWiki]].
